       9999-CAMBIA-TASA-NOMINAL.

           INITIALIZE RWCCVT-AREA

           MOVE ZEROS             TO CVT-PUNTOS
           MOVE WS-CI-TEAP        TO CVT-TASA
           MOVE 'N'               TO CVT-RESULTADO
           MOVE NSCF-PERI         TO CVT-PERINT
           MOVE NSCF-PLAZO        TO CVT-PLAZO
           MOVE ADS-CODTIPRE      TO CVT-TIPO-TASA
           MOVE 'S'               TO CVT-IND-CONV

           IF CVT-TIPO-TASA = SPACES OR LOW-VALUES
              MOVE 'DTF'          TO CVT-TIPO-TASA
           END-IF

           EXEC CICS
               LINK PROGRAM  ('UR1CCVT0')
               COMMAREA (URWCCVT)
               NOHANDLE
           END-EXEC

           IF EIBRESP NOT EQUAL DFHRESP(NORMAL)
              MOVE CTE-UGE0939             TO CAA-COD-ERROR
              MOVE 'ERROR LINK UR1CCVT0'  TO CAA-VAR2-ERROR
              PERFORM  3-FIN-PROGRAMA
           END-IF

           IF CVT-COD-ERROR = ZEROS
                CONTINUE
             ELSE
              MOVE CTE-UGE0517             TO CAA-COD-ERROR
              MOVE CTE-UR1CCVT0            TO CAA-VAR1-ERROR
              MOVE CVT-COD-ERROR           TO CAA-VAR2-ERROR
              PERFORM  3-FIN-PROGRAMA
           END-IF.
