      ******************************************************************
      *                      22023-CALCULA-CUOTA                       *
      ******************************************************************
       22023-CALCULA-CUOTA.

           INITIALIZE                         COT-NIVEL-01
	   	      MOVE ADS-PERCAP                    TO WS-PER-CAPITAL
           MOVE NSCF-VLRCRED                  TO COT-CAPITAL
           MOVE CVT-NOMINAL                   TO COT-INT-NOMINAL
           MOVE ZEROS                         TO COT-INT-EFECTIVO
           MOVE 1                             TO COT-TIP-CUOTA
           MOVE ZERO                          TO COT-AJUSTE-ENTREGAS

           EVALUATE WS-TIPO-PER-CAP
             WHEN 1
               COMPUTE COT-AMO-ANNO  ROUNDED = 365 /  WS-PERIODO-CAP
               END-COMPUTE
             WHEN 2
               COMPUTE COT-AMO-ANNO   ROUNDED = 12 / WS-PERIODO-CAP
               END-COMPUTE
             WHEN 3
               COMPUTE COT-AMO-ANNO   ROUNDED = 1  / WS-PERIODO-CAP
               END-COMPUTE
             WHEN 9
               MOVE ZERO                      TO COT-AMO-ANNO
             WHEN  OTHER
               MOVE 'UGE0939'                 TO CAA-COD-ERROR
               MOVE 'ADS-PERCAP'              TO CAA-VAR1-ERROR
               PERFORM 3-FIN-PROGRAMA
           END-EVALUATE

           MOVE ZEROES                        TO COT-DIAS-PRI-LIQ
           MOVE SPACES                        TO COT-ENTIOFI
           MOVE SPACES                        TO COT-CUENTA
           MOVE '1001'                        TO COT-PERCAPIT
           PERFORM 243-SIGUI-FECHA-AMORT
           MOVE DFP-FECHA-FINAL               TO COT-F-AMORTI
           MOVE ADS-PERCAP                    TO COT-PERCAP
           MOVE ADS-TIPODIAS                  TO COT-TIPODIAS
           MOVE ADS-PERCAP                    TO COT-PERINT
           MOVE 'C'                           TO COT-DIASCAL
           MOVE WS-DATE-SCREEN-DIA            TO COT-UGCDIPAG
           MOVE 'S'                           TO COT-CALCULAR-A
           MOVE ZEROS                         TO COT-FACTOR-A
           MOVE DFP-FECHA-FINAL               TO COT-F-FORMA
           MOVE CTE-CON-NOMINAL               TO COT-TIPO-CAR
           MOVE ZEROS                         TO COT-PORC-FINAL
           MOVE ZEROS                         TO COT-RAZON
           MOVE WS-NUMCUO-TOTAL-G             TO COT-TOT-AMORT-PEN
           MOVE 'S'                           TO CUA-SIMULACION
           MOVE ADS-CODTIPRE                  TO COT-CODIGO

           EXEC CICS LINK                                               00208100
              PROGRAM ('UR1CCOT0')                                      00208200
              COMMAREA (COT-NIVEL-01)                                   00208300
           END-EXEC                                                     00208400

           EVALUATE COT-CODIGO
             WHEN ZERO
                 MOVE COT-CUOTA               TO WS-CUOT-PRIMUNIC
                 IF WS-CUOT-PRIMUNIC EQUAL ZEROS
                    MOVE 'CSE0068'            TO CAA-COD-ERROR
                    MOVE 'CUOT.MEMS'          TO CAA-VAR1-ERROR
                    PERFORM 3-FIN-PROGRAMA
                 END-IF
             WHEN OTHER
                 MOVE 'UGE0939'               TO CAA-COD-ERROR
                 MOVE 'ERROR RUT. UR8CCOT0'   TO CAA-VAR1-ERROR
                 MOVE COT-CODIGO              TO CAA-VAR2-ERROR
                 PERFORM 3-FIN-PROGRAMA
           END-EVALUATE.
      ******************************************************************
      *                  243-SIGUI-FECHA-AMORT                         *
      *  SE CALCULAN LAS SIGUIENTES FECHAS DE AMORTIZACION Y           *
      *  DE LIQUIDACION.                                               *
      ******************************************************************
       243-SIGUI-FECHA-AMORT.

           MOVE CAA-FECHA-OPER2               TO DFP-FECHA-INICIAL
           MOVE CAA-FECHA-OPER2               TO WS-DATE-SCREEN
           MOVE WS-DATE-SCREEN-DIA            TO DFP-DIA
      *
           MOVE ZERO                          TO WS-UGCDIPAG
      *
           MOVE ADS-PERCAP                    TO DFP-PERCAP
           MOVE 1                             TO DFP-NUM-PERIODOS
           MOVE ADS-TIPODIAS                  TO DFP-TIPODIAS

           IF  WS-DATE-SCREEN-MES = 2  AND
              (WS-DATE-SCREEN-DIA = 28  OR WS-DATE-SCREEN-DIA = 29)
               MOVE WS-DATE-SCREEN-DIA        TO DFP-DIA
           END-IF

           CALL 'UR9CDFP0' USING URECDFP

           IF DFP-CORESPUE NOT = CTE-10
              MOVE 'UGE0939'                  TO CAA-COD-ERROR
              MOVE 'ERROR RUT. UR9CDFP0'      TO CAA-VAR1-ERROR
              MOVE DFP-CORESPUE               TO CAA-VAR2-ERROR
              PERFORM 3-FIN-PROGRAMA
           END-IF.
